(79f5), and the cockpit-view CAMERA LOADER (a84c) -- the keystone of the op-0x24 terrain path.  Paired
with the shim's extender frame-ready handshake in tools/native_main.c (fist_timer_pump: on the mission
cockpit path a84c/795c set d549=0x1c + d548=1; the Doug-Huffman extender's PM flight model -- absent from
FIST.DAT -- OR-s bit7 -> d548=0x81, the gate 795c tests to run a20d(camera) + df0e -> aa10=0x24 -> e339
-> the extender 9200 voxel windshield.  Emulated in the shim, gated on d549==0x1c so it is behaviour-
neutral for the 19 pre-mission flows).  All asm-verified vs re_out/fist_dat_image.bin (DS=DGROUP=0x1c00):

